---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Plateau Playbook — Free Org Chart Call for Law Firm Owners"
  description="Who to hire at $500K, $1M, $2M, and $5M, and what you stop doing at each stage. Book a free call and find out which boxes still have your name in them."
  noindex={true}
  schema={{
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "The Plateau Playbook",
    "description": "A free staffing call for law firm owners stuck between $1M and $2M, built around the org chart at four revenue stages.",
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Attorney Assistant"
    }
  }}
>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       HERO
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-brand-950 min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--1" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--2" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="lp-orb lp-orb--3" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] opacity-[0.03]" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div class="mb-5">
            <span class="lp-pulse-badge">
              <span class="lp-pulse-dot"></span>
              For Law Firm Owners
            </span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-display-md md:text-display-lg lg:text-display-xl font-heading text-white leading-tight mb-5">
            You didn't hit a ceiling. <span class="text-gradient-gold">You hit your own calendar.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Who to hire at $500K, $1M, $2M, and $5M &mdash; and what you have to stop doing at each stage for revenue to move again.
          </p>

          <!-- Stat ticker -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-10">
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="3">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">hours billed in an average 8-hour day</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="5">0</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">hours a day on work that needs no law license</span>
            </div>
            <div class="lp-hero-stat">
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-num">$</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num lp-count" data-target="480">0</span><span class="lp-hero-stat-num">K</span>
              <span class="lp-hero-stat-label">a year in attorney time spent on $20&ndash;$30 work</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- What the call covers -->
          <div class="space-y-4 mb-10">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">On Your Call We'll Cover</p>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Which stage your firm is actually in</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">$500K to $1M, the plateau stage, the associate stage, or past it &mdash; and the one hire that matters next.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.306a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.518l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.281m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">How many boxes still have your name in them</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">We'll count them live. Most owners guess wrong in both directions.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-white">The one hire to make next, in order</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-0.5">Not an associate. Most firms hire the wrong role first and keep every bottleneck they had.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Free &mdash; 30 minutes
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              No commitment
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.704 4.153a.75.75 0 01.143 1.052l-8 10.5a.75.75 0 01-1.127.075l-4.5-4.5a.75.75 0 011.06-1.06l3.894 3.893 7.48-9.817a.75.75 0 011.05-.143z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>
              Built inside a working law firm
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Booking Widget -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-1 shadow-2xl ring-1 ring-white/10 reveal lp-widget-glow" style="transition-delay: 150ms" id="book-now">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
              <div class="featured-icon featured-icon-md featured-icon-gold">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-heading text-gray-900">Book Your Staffing Call</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Free &mdash; 30 minutes</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="meetings-iframe-container" data-src="https://meet.attorneyassistant.com/meetings/attorney-assistant/magnet-the-plateau-playbook?embed=true"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-10 lp-scroll-hint" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="w-6 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white/20 flex justify-center pt-2">
        <div class="w-1 h-2.5 bg-brand-gold rounded-full lp-scroll-dot"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       OPENING — the story + three bad hires
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/5 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-red-500/3 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <!-- Left: Story -->
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-6">Read This First</span>
          <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
            Most firms stall somewhere between $1M and $2M.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            The owner is working more hours than ever. Revenue is flat. Every new hire seems to create more work instead of less. The usual diagnosis is a marketing problem. It almost never is.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            The firm stalls because the owner is still doing jobs the firm should have given away two stages ago &mdash; intake, follow-up, scheduling, records, billing, client updates. Each one is a role. At $500K you can carry them. At $1.5M you cannot, and the firm grows exactly as fast as you can personally work.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xl font-heading text-brand-gold">
            The system is people in the right seats.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: three hires that hold the plateau in place -->
        <div class="reveal space-y-4" style="transition-delay: 150ms">
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-1">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">1 &middot; Hiring the associate first</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">The owner wants relief from casework, so the first hire is a lawyer. The lawyer now needs intake, admin, and case support too. The firm doubled its attorney cost and kept every bottleneck.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-2">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 12c0-1.232-.046-2.453-.138-3.662a4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7-3.7 48.678 48.678 0 00-7.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 00-3.7 3.7c-.017.22-.032.441-.046.662M19.5 12l3-3m-3 3l-3-3m-12 3c0 1.232.046 2.453.138 3.662a4.006 4.006 0 003.7 3.7 48.656 48.656 0 007.324 0 4.006 4.006 0 003.7-3.7c.017-.22.032-.441.046-.662M4.5 12l3 3m-3-3l-3 3" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">2 &middot; Hiring a generalist to do everything</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">One person covering phones, records, scheduling, and billing is one person doing four jobs badly. Intake and case support are different skills on different hours.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="lp-pain-card lp-pain-card--stagger-3">
            <div class="lp-pain-icon">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-white font-heading text-base">3 &middot; Hiring and walking away</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1">The person starts, gets a login and a desk, and gets no process, no feedback, and no first-30-days plan. They leave in month four. The owner concludes that hiring doesn't work.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner mt-14 max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal">
        &ldquo;Nobody quits a firm that trained them. They quit the firm that handed them a login.&rdquo;
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE ARITHMETIC
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-brand-gold to-brand-blue"></div>
    <div class="container-wide">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-navy/10 text-brand-navy border-brand-navy/15 mb-4">Why Growth Stops When You Are The Org Chart</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-gray-900 mb-4">
          You're already paying for this. You just aren't billing it.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          The average lawyer bills about 3 of 8 hours a day &mdash; 38% utilization. The other 5 go to intake calls, chasing records, scheduling, status updates, invoices, and follow-up, none of which needs a law license.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 reveal mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="lp-stat-box">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num">3.0</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Hours billed per day</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">5</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Hours a day on non-billable work</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num">38%</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Utilization</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-400 mb-10 reveal">Source: Clio 2025 Legal Trends Report.</p>

      <div class="lp-rule-box max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-10 text-center">
        <span class="lp-rule-box-label">The Arithmetic</span>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-navy font-heading">
          At $400 an hour, 5 non-billable hours a day is $2,000 a day spent on $20&ndash;$30 an hour work. Over 240 working days, that is <span class="text-brand-gold">$480,000 a year</span> in capacity the firm paid for and did not bill.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lp-quote-banner max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal mb-10">
        &ldquo;Hiring only fixes this if you hire for the work you are actually doing.&rdquo;
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-lg font-heading text-gray-900 max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal">
        Most owners hire for the work they wish they were doing. They add an associate to take cases while they keep answering the phone, and the plateau holds.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════
       THE FOUR STAGES
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden lp-section-lg">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-navy via-brand-900 to-brand-950"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-brand-gold/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-blue/8 rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
    <div class="grain-overlay"></div>

    <div class="container-wide relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
        <span class="badge bg-brand-gold/15 text-brand-gold border-brand-gold/20 mb-4">The Org Chart</span>
        <h2 class="text-display-sm md:text-display-md font-heading text-white mb-5">
          Four stages. <span class="text-gradient-gold">A different owner at each one.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Revenue does not set your stage. Your calendar does. Find the stage where your own name is still in the most boxes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto reveal mb-14">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-blue font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-blue uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 1 &middot; $500K&ndash;$1M</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Get the phone off your desk</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">First hire owns intake and follow-up, 40 hours a week. Taking a message is not intake. You stop answering first calls and chasing leads who didn't call back.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-gold/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-gold font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-gold uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 2 &middot; $1M&ndash;$2M</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">The plateau stage &mdash; hire for the back of the case</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Intake is covered, so leads come in, and the owner becomes the bottleneck on the other side. Add a dedicated case manager and a dedicated admin seat. You stop doing client updates, records requests, calendar management, and document assembly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5 border-b border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 3 &middot; $2M&ndash;$5M</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Now you hire the associate</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">The support structure can carry the volume, so adding an attorney finally adds revenue instead of adding supervision. The associate is the fourth or fifth hire, not the first.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 py-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:w-48 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-heading font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Stage 4 &middot; $5M+</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-white font-heading text-base mb-1">Out of every box but one</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Every function has a lead. The rule is simple: if a task doesn't require your license or your judgment, it is not your task. Your job is the firm, not the cases.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5 reveal mb-6">
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">97%</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Answer rate 24/7, up from 82% in-hours only</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">15 min</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Max speed to lead, down from a 34-minute average</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">6</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Follow-up touches in the first 3 days</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-stat-box lp-stat-box--highlight">
          <div class="lp-stat-box-num lp-stat-box-num--gold">109</div>
          <p class="lp-stat-box-label">Cases signed by one staff member in 30 days</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 mb-10 reveal">Attorney Assistant client figures, real client files, identities protected.</p>

      <div class="text-center reveal">
        <a href="#book-now" class="btn-primary btn-lg group inline-flex">
          Find Your Stage
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3 10a.75.75 0 01.75-.75h10.638L10.23 5.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-5.5 5.25a.75.75 0 11-1.04-1.08l4.158-3.96H3.75A.75.75 0 013 10z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
